[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0982","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0982.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0866","title":"Borland Interbase 6 SuperServer 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Interbase 6 SuperServer for Linux 存在拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过向数据库服务器发送包含 0 字节的特制查询请求，导致服务进程崩溃或停止响应。该漏洞源于服务器对畸形查询请求的处理缺陷，未对输入数据进行充分校验。攻击者需具有本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可触发，影响 Interbase 6 版本在 Linux 平台上的稳定运行。由于 CVSS 评分仅 2.1，危害等级较低，但可能导致业务中断。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0866"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37Z","remediation":"升级至 InterBase 6 Service Pack 1 或更高版本，该补丁修复了零字节查询导致服务崩溃的问题。如无法升级，限制本地用户对 InterBase SuperServer 的访问权限，仅允许受信任的管理员账户连接数据库服务。对于仍在使用该版本的环境，建议迁移至受支持的 InterBase 2020 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0027.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1654","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5205"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0982.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0981","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0981.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0863","title":"Linux Listmanager 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统自带的 listmanager 工具（版本低于 2.105.1）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞向 listmanager 程序发送特制的输入数据，触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖进程内存空间，获取额外的系统权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，成功利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0863"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37Z","remediation":"升级 listmanager 至 2.105.1 或更高版本。如无法升级，限制不可信用户对 listmanager 程序的本地访问权限，仅允许受信任的管理员用户执行。同时移除 listmanager 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /path/to/listmanager）以降低提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-09/0111.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0863","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e395c3db94a950cbea9721adc43f1bb4a8ebb0e4/2000/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0863.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0863.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0863.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0981.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0980","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0980.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0862","title":"Allaire Spectra 管理界面敏感配置信息泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire Spectra 1.0.1 的管理界面工具存在未授权访问漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络访问该管理接口，进而读取或修改服务器的敏感配置信息，导致系统配置泄露或被篡改。攻击条件低，仅需目标系统开放管理界面端口即可利用，影响系统机密性和完整性。厂商已发布修复建议，建议升级至最新版本或限制管理界面的网络访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0862"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Allaire Spectra 至 1.0.2 或更高版本（厂商已发布安全补丁修复管理接口未授权访问问题）。如无法升级，应在防火墙或反向代理层面将管理接口（默认路径 /admin 或 /spectra/admin）的访问权限限制为仅可信内网 IP，禁止从公网直接访问该管理界面，同时删除或重命名服务器上不必要的管理工具脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vendor/2000-q3/0059.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5466","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0862","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e395c3db94a950cbea9721adc43f1bb4a8ebb0e4/2000/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0862.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0862.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0862.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0980.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0979","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0979.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0861","title":"GNU Mailman 命令注入漏洞","description":"Mailman 1.1 邮件列表管理系统中存在命令注入漏洞，列表管理员在设置列表名称时，%(listname) 宏展开未能正确过滤 shell 元字符，攻击者可利用该漏洞在服务器上以 Mailman 进程权限执行任意系统命令，导致服务器被完全控制。该漏洞需要列表管理员权限方可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0861"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Mailman 至 2.0 或更高版本，该漏洞在 2.0 中已修复，对 %(listname) 宏展开中的 shell 元字符进行了正确转义处理。如无法升级，可在 mailman 配置中禁用列表管理员通过 Web 界面创建新列表的功能，并严格限制可管理列表的用户范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0040.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-09/0112.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1667","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5493","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0861","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2000/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0861.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0861.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0861.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0979.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0979.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0978","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0978.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0860","title":"PHP 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"PHP 3.x 和 4.x 版本的文件上传功能存在任意文件读取漏洞。攻击者可通过构造与 PHP 内部脚本变量同名的隐藏表单字段，利用文件上传机制中的变量覆盖缺陷，绕过正常访问控制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，主要影响使用 PHP 文件上传功能的 Web 应用服务器，可导致敏感信息泄露。官方已在后续版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0860"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 4.0.2 或更高版本（该版本修复了 rfc1867.c 中文件上传处理函数对内部变量名的校验缺陷）。如无法升级，在 php.ini 中将 register_globals 设为 Off 可缓解攻击，同时避免在表单中使用与内部变量同名的隐藏字段。鉴于 PHP 3/4 已停止安全支持多年，强烈建议迁移至受支持的 PHP 8.x 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0455.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0477.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0150.html","http://cvsweb.php.net/viewcvs.cgi/php4/main/rfc1867.c.diff?r1=1.38%3Aphp_4_0_2&tr1=1.1&r2=text&tr2=1.45&diff_format=u","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1649","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5190","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0860","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0860.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2000/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0860.json","https://github.com/psecio/versionscan/blob/81cee8accd05924b8421db9ed2a867047819d15a/CONTRIBUTING.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0978.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0978.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0978.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0977","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0977.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0859","title":"Gordano NTMail Web Configuration Server HTTP请求处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Gordano NTMail 5.0 和 6.0 版本的 Web 配置服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标服务器发送一系列不完整的 HTTP 请求，导致服务器资源耗尽或进程崩溃，从而使邮件服务不可用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可触发，影响 NTMail 5.0 及 6.0 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0859"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:37Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，厂商 Gordano 已停止运营，无官方补丁可用。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Exchange、Postfix 等）。若无法立即迁移，可在防火墙层面限制仅信任 IP 访问 NTMail Web 配置服务端口（默认 80/443），或直接禁用 Web 配置服务模块以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0471.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1640","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0859","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fbdcc0a51e272b519ec8a57a1db338df26d96406/2000/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0859.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0859.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0859.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0977.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0977.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0976","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0976.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0858","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 畸形URL请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 存在\"Invalid URL\"拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标 IIS 服务器发送一系列特制的畸形 URL 请求，触发 INETINFO.EXE 进程崩溃，导致 IIS 服务无法正常响应合法请求。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统上运行的 IIS 4.0 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0858"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-063 提供的 Windows NT 4.0 补丁（KB271652），下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=B2A1FED4-F251-4233-B911-22C4DD81438E。如无法打补丁，可升级至 IIS 5.0（Windows 2000），该版本不受此漏洞影响。服务因攻击失败后重启 IIS 服务即可恢复，无需重启系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vendor/2000-q3/0065.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/80413","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1642","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5202","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee