,"collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0067.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0068.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1665","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5215","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0857","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cbf0905811e3a7a53efa9a65584bb426cc9bcca8/2000/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0857.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0857.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0857.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0975.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0974","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0974.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0856","title":"xs4all SunFTP 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SunFTP build 9(1) 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 FTP 服务发送超长的 GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃造成拒绝服务，或可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 SunFTP build 9(1) 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前尚无官方补丁发布，建议限制对 FTP 服务的访问权限以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0856"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36Z","remediation":"SunFTP build 9(1) 已停止维护，厂商未提供安全补丁。建议立即停止使用 SunFTP，迁移至仍受支持的 FTP 服务器软件（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD）。若无法立即迁移，应在防火墙层面限制对 SunFTP 端口（默认 21）的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并部署入侵检测规则监控超长 GET 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0408.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1638","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0856","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/30161b4638c37443322916a4d97a62c41686781e/2000/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c80cd921505a9f88e4aae41f1414ac3763e708ba/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0856.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0856.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0856.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0974.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0973","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0973.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0855","title":"Rasmus J.P. Allenheim SunFTP 1.0 Build 9 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SunFTP 1.0 Build 9 存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过建立 FTP 连接后，在发送换行符之前主动断开连接，导致服务器无法正确处理异常连接状态，从而消耗服务器资源并造成服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 SunFTP 1.0 Build 9 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，危害等级中等。目前厂商已停止维护该产品，建议用户升级至更高版本或更换其他 FTP 服务器软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0855"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36Z","remediation":"升级 SunFTP 至 build 9(1) 之后的版本（如 build 10 或更高），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。由于 SunFTP 已停止维护，建议迁移至其他活跃维护的 FTP 服务器软件（如 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd）。如无法立即更换，可在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口的来源 IP 范围，仅允许可信 IP 连接，降低被攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0408.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1637","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0855","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/30161b4638c37443322916a4d97a62c41686781e/2000/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0855.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0855.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0855.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0973.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0972","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0972.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0852","title":"FreeBSD eject 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中的 eject 工具存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 eject 程序传递特制的命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，实现权限提升并获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 及可能其他类 Unix 操作系统，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0852"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 FreeBSD 系统至包含补丁的版本（FreeBSD-SA-00:43），或从 FreeBSD CVS 仓库获取 eject 源码补丁并重新编译安装。如无法升级，可移除 eject 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/eject）以消除本地提权风险，但会丧失普通用户直接调用 eject 的功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-09/0110.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1559","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1686","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5248","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0852","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/34eb3a7695e83b6a33083dbe114e8beca526a149/2000/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0852.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0852.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0852.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0972.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0971","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0971.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0850","title":"Netegrity SiteMinder 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Netegrity SiteMinder 4.11 之前版本存在认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者通过在请求 URL 后附加 \"$/FILENAME.ext\"（其中 ext 为 .ccc、.class 或 .jpg）即可绕过身份认证机制，未经授权访问受保护的资源。该漏洞无需身份验证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露或系统被非法访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0850"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 Netegrity SiteMinder 至 4.11 或更高版本，该版本已修复 URL 认证绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 \"$/\" 及 .ccc/.class/.jpg 后缀的请求路径，并限制对受保护资源的直接 URL 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a091100-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1681","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5230","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0850","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/14d874e761633e61e3b45458431a87e35478bd2b/2000/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0850.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0850.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0850.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0971.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0971.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0971.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0970","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0970.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0849","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Services Unicast Service 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Media Services 4.0 及 4.1 版本的 Unicast Service 存在竞争条件漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的畸形请求，利用该竞争条件导致 Windows Media Unicast Service 服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，但利用复杂度较高（需精确时序控制），影响 Windows Media Services 4.0/4.1 版本。Microsoft 已发布安全公告并建议用户安装相应补丁。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0849"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:35Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-064 提供的补丁。Windows Media Services 4.1 用户直接下载安装补丁（https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=BF954D4E-3C89-47EF-92E6-5030288731EF）；Windows Media Services 4.0 用户需先升级至 4.1 版本再安装补丁。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面禁用或限制对 UDP/TCP 1755 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1655","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-064","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5193","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0849","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/14d874e761633e61e3b45458431a87e35478bd2b/2000/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0849.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0849.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0849.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0970.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0969","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0969.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0847","title":"University of Washington c-client 库缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"华盛顿大学 c-client 库（被 pine 等邮件客户端使用）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标邮件服务器发送包含超长 X-Keywords 头的特制邮件触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响使用 c-client 库的多个邮件客户端及服务器软件，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0847"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 University of Washington c-client 库至 imap-2000 及以上版本，该版本修复了 X-Keywords 头处理中的缓冲区溢出问题。使用 pine 邮件客户端的用户应同步升级至 pine 4.44 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 MTA 或邮件网关层面过滤包含超长 X-Keywords 头的邮件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0425.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0437.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-09/0108.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1646","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1687","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0847","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2000/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0847.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0847.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2000-0847.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0969.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0968","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0968.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0845","title":"Digital Unix kdebugd 远程任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Digital UNIX 4.0F 系统中的 kdebug 调试守护进程（kdebugd）存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送特制的初始化数据包，在其中指定任意文件的完整路径名，从而读取系统上的任意文件，包括敏感配置文件、密码文件等。该漏洞影响 Digital UNIX 4.0F 版本，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危，可能导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0845"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:35Z","remediation":"立即停止并禁用 kdebugd 守护进程（kdebug daemon），该服务默认监听 UDP 端口，可通过 `chkconfig kdebugd off` 或删除 `/etc/inetd.conf` 中相关条目后重启 inetd 来禁用。在无法禁用的情况下，在防火墙上限制对 kdebugd 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。Digital Unix 4.0F 已停止技术支持，建议升级到受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0204.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0845","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2000/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0845.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0845.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2000/CVE-2000-0845.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0968.toml"}]